meta {
  name: Favourite
  type: http
  seq: 15
}

put {
  url: {{api}}/entries/{{partnerEntryId}}/favourite
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Marks an entry as a favourite: 204, and 204 again if it already was. The mark is yours alone; your partner is never shown it, on any route.

  Run Days first, which keeps your partner's entry of the newest day as partnerEntryId. Your own entry can be marked too: put entryId in the URL. Only a revealed entry can be marked. Your own, while it waits for your partner, is 409 ENTRY_NOT_REVEALED; one that has been deleted is 409 ENTRY_IMMUTABLE; anything you were never shown is 404.
}
